  24:../../firmware/debugger/debugger_port.c **** /**
  25:../../firmware/debugger/debugger_port.c ****  * Receive characters from the debug interface.
  26:../../firmware/debugger/debugger_port.c ****  * Should normally just report exactly any characters received from the interface
  27:../../firmware/debugger/debugger_port.c ****  * Does not need to care about the contents or whether a messsage is complete.
  28:../../firmware/debugger/debugger_port.c ****  * If you are doing something exotic complete messages work well too, but it should
  29:../../firmware/debugger/debugger_port.c ****  * respect max_size (most rsp messages should fit in a normal max_size buffer though).
  30:../../firmware/debugger/debugger_port.c ****  * */
